Understanding laboratory results — MedlinePlus (@med-source-labs: 0, is #reference, #part-of @medicine-sources) { r_25V23BVCGB9VZ631XN4GZS05SA
US National Library of Medicine, MedlinePlus. How to Understand Your Lab Results. English.

[Authorized source](https://medlineplus.gov/lab-tests/how-to-understand-your-lab-results/).

Introduces reference ranges, positive and negative findings, false results, and the need to interpret measurements with the clinical question. The invented arithmetic example in the guide is separate from any actual test-performance estimate.

